cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
  If you are citing the underlying research, please use the
  "preferred-citation" (the dissertation) instead.
title: neurofault
type: software
abstract: >-
  Fault-tolerant memristive crossbar neuromorphic computing simulation:
  crossbar fault injection (stuck-at, drift, runtime faults) against
  health-monitoring mitigation strategies (soft mitigation, targeted layer
  reset, redundancy remapping, fault-aware retraining), across multiple
  device technologies (VTEAM, FeFET, STT-MRAM) and two simulation backends
  (Sandia CrossSim, IBM AIHWKit).
authors:
  - family-names: Yadav
    given-names: Prateek
repository-code: >-
